{
  "duration": 76.579,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 1.36,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.019,
      "end": 3.519,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.139,
      "end": 4.92,
      "text": "Now in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.579,
      "end": 6.339,
      "text": "we are given that"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.92,
      "end": 8.039,
      "text": "the speed of the boat"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.539,
      "end": 9.5,
      "text": "in still water"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.199,
      "end": 10.319,
      "text": "is"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.639,
      "end": 12.0,
      "text": "20 kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.719,
      "end": 15.439,
      "text": "Also, the speed of the current is four kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.159,
      "end": 19.619,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find the time needed to cover"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.059,
      "end": 20.459,
      "text": "64"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.02,
      "end": 22.519,
      "text": "kilometer upstream."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.119,
      "end": 24.079,
      "text": "Now before solving,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.639,
      "end": 26.799,
      "text": "let us understand one simple concept."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.199,
      "end": 28.519,
      "text": "When a boat moves upstream,"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.0,
      "end": 31.059,
      "text": "it is moving against the flow of the river,"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.739,
      "end": 33.559,
      "text": "so the current slows the boat down."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.0,
      "end": 39.0,
      "text": "That is why upstream speed is equal to speed of boat in still water,"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.599,
      "end": 41.279,
      "text": "minus speed of current."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.639,
      "end": 43.299,
      "text": "Now let us find the upstream speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.7,
      "end": 44.719,
      "text": "Putting the values,"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.2,
      "end": 46.36,
      "text": "upstream speed is equal to"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.799,
      "end": 47.919,
      "text": "20 minus four."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.419,
      "end": 53.279,
      "text": "After simplifying this, we get 16 kilometers per hour. Now this part is completed."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.68,
      "end": 57.619,
      "text": "We already know the upstream speed, so now we can find the required time."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.039,
      "end": 58.999,
      "text": "We know the formula."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.539,
      "end": 62.319,
      "text": "Time is equal to distance divided by speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.699,
      "end": 63.659,
      "text": "Putting the values,"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.059,
      "end": 68.839,
      "text": "time is equal to 64 divided by 16. After simplifying this, we get four hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.339,
      "end": 73.5,
      "text": "So the time needed to cover 64 kilometer upstream is four hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.979,
      "end": 76.579,
      "text": "Hence, the correct answer is option D."
    }
  ],
